{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">2021 Fall AMC 10A #4</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 Fall AMC 12A #3</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mr. Lopez has a choice of two routes to get to work. Route A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles long, and his average speed along this route is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. Route B is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles long, and his average speed along this route is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour, except for a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />-mile stretch in a school zone where his average speed is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour. By how many minutes is Route B quicker than Route A?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64eaeca4e86ab63866496e6d422abb775e142761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2 \\frac{3}{4}  \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\  3 \\frac{3}{4} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\  4 \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\  5 \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 6 \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"416\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Mr. Lopez chooses Route A, then he will spend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/c/d4c6161b827e4185e0b0e528785dc866729d050d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{30}=\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" /> hour, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc95d7fec3fe2222d5fb179f51c72c7e7079b08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot60=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>If Mr. Lopez chooses Route B, then he will spend <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/5880586d8d2369109eaa2ca2afd1216ae79aba28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9/2}{40}+\\frac{1/2}{20}=\\frac{11}{80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" /> hour, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/9/629bd7c38c1676ea7a5975c1bc253992a54a0ef1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{11}{80}\\cdot60=8\\frac14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>Therefore, Route B is quicker than Route A by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/e/ece8886211aaf6f7d874e693659dfbc4cf2dd2ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12-8\\frac14=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\  3 \\frac{3}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"156\" height=\"49\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We use the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/1358475dab9c64952d8423776bad0cb55ec0ec37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=st$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> to solve this problem. Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> mile per hour is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/6/8f60bedc5b5b46bbd2652971d30b4e69bfad748a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> mile per minute.\n</p><p>For Route A, the distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> miles and the speed to travel this distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> mile per minute. Thus, the time it takes on Route A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes.\n</p><p>For Route B, we have to use the equation twice: once for the distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb3ba852a5b549175aa629732fba8350a01ee2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5- \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{9}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"84\" height=\"38\" /> miles with a speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> mile per minute and a distance of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> miles at a speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> mile per minute. Thus, the time it takes to go on Route B is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/c/92c520db2f36f67810442ece018eafcb56efdef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{2} \\cdot \\frac{3}{2} + \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{27}{4} + \\frac{3}{2} = \\frac{33}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"38\" /> minutes. Thus, Route B is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/1/7c1013110acf16ffb051529857c97ea0c8b49ba1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 - \\frac{33}{4} = \\frac{15}{4} = 3\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"38\" /> faster than Route A. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/d/bed560ac9c9834c748c6afe02701de5d4d799b58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\  3 \\frac{3}{4}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"74\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~NH14\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Simple_and_Quick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Simple and Quick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jE8kjbkcrwI\">https://youtu.be/jE8kjbkcrwI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/MIsp9QysU7Y\">https://youtu.be/MIsp9QysU7Y</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/F4om1fIfYYw\">https://youtu.be/F4om1fIfYYw</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>for AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/o98vGHAUYjM?t=389\">https://youtu.be/o98vGHAUYjM?t=389</a>\n</p><p>for AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jY-17W6dA3c?t=158\">https://youtu.be/jY-17W6dA3c?t=158</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Si1AMjHYxGE\">https://youtu.be/Si1AMjHYxGE</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jE8kjbkcrwI\">https://youtu.be/jE8kjbkcrwI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A\" title=\"2